     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Amount and genitive",
     "texto": [
      "After many expressions of amount, the noun appears in the genitive: **szklanka wody**, **kilogram jabłek**, **dużo pracy**.",
      "English also uses «of» in several of these expressions. Polish usually changes the form of the noun and does not add a separate word equivalent to «of»."
     ],
